"Wie Retro Hex Chat funktioniert — Server, Leerzeichen, Anrufe & Datenschutz"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/live/landing_live/how_it_works.ex:52
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid ""
"Learn how Retro Hex Chat works: self-hosted chat, virtual Spaces, private "
"WebRTC P2P sessions, channel conferences, privacy, and security."
